{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12225730","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12225730","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:6:1222573001:1":{"text":"That fish... could it be Harak?","source_cn":"那条鱼……是哈拉克吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD8AAF14F830E1840","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1222573002:1":{"text":"That bottle has become his prison!","source_cn":"玻璃瓶变成了封印他的容器！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x843164793360532E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1222573003:1":{"text":"No, it's a beautiful decoration! Harak ruined the little garden I arranged, so now he can become a part of the garden himself.","source_cn":"不，是精美漂亮的摆件！哈拉克毁了我布置的小花园，现在就...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D0260F118A57584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1222573004:1":{"text":"You know, when he's not showing his teeth, this little shark almost looks cute from here.","source_cn":"哎呀，只要不露出尖牙，从这个角度看，这条瓶中小鲨鱼好像...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1C6887A5AC2220E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1222573005:1":{"text":"Harak won't escape again, will he?","source_cn":"哈拉克不会再跑出来吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3CBF5CE8714A885","variant_status":"","